1
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:17,120
Victims of the virtual currency
Fullcoin scam

2
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:18,320
are still pursuing their claim.

3
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,280
Rumor has it, even Yip Wing-kei,

4
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:23,120
the Showbiz King has fallen victim
to the scam.

5
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:25,440
Businessman Wong Sai-lung who
launched Fullcoin

6
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,560
is allegedly the mastermind behind the scam.

7
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,880
Just drinking water?

8
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:40,000
I want to clear my mind before the job.

9
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,920
The Boss said the target is a handful.

10
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,520
You should eat while you can.

11
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:49,760
Cheung Tin-fai, Fullcoin victim #1,
triad thug.

12
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,080
First rate muscleman, but lousy with
personal finance.

13
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,200
Fallen prey to the scam, heavily in debt.

14
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,480
After his wife and child left him,

15
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:57,680
he reluctantly became a hitman.

16
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,040
Brother Fu, have an egg tart.

17
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,240
Chin Tai-fu, mastermind of the
Fullcoin scam.

18
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,440
A heartless billionaire.

19
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:17,840
Allegedly he conned a fortune from
Yip Wing-kei

20
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,680
who put a price on his head.

21
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,120
He's now on the run.

22
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,960
Did you see the news today?

23
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:24,680
Well...

24
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,360
Don't "well" me!

25
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,280
Don't speak English!

26
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,160
Pretending to be a foreigner?

27
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,080
You're just a punk.

28
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,000
Why didn't your man get to work?

29
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,160
You know the Showbiz King hired a hit on me.

30
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:36,000
You want me to die first?

31
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,720
The Showbiz King doesn't go out

32
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,000
and is surrounded by bodyguards.

33
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,240
The cost to kill him is very high.

34
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,240
You only gave me a $2M budget.

35
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,440
It's not that easy to find a hitman.

36
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,200
Don't talk to me about money.

37
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,880
You've been on my payroll long enough.

38
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,960
Don't worry. I hired a hitman.

39
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:55,680
I'm waiting for the right moment
to give the order.

40
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,960
The Showbiz King will be a dead man.

41
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,440
Wong Sai-lung, triad boss.

42
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:04,000
He started out doing the dirty work
for Chin Tai-fu.

43
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,720
New to the business world,
he's in charge of Fullcoin.

44
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,360
He and Chin Tai-fu created
the Fullcoin scam.

45
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:12,080
Hired a hitman to take out his boss' enemy.

46
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:18,000
The location is set. Get ready.

47
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,840
Do it today.

48
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,760
Get ready!

49
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:26,640
We'll tell you who the target is later.

50
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:28,560
Why so secretive?

51
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:32,680
Your wife and two daughters
have boarded the plane safely.

52
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,880
I'm putting you up in a hotel.

53
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,360
Which one?

54
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,320
I picked a boutique hotel.

55
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:40,640
Less traffic, more manageable.

56
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:43,440
I instructed the hotel

57
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,360
no one should know you're in the hotel.

58
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:48,480
The Showbiz King won't find you.

59
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,600
Roy, drive!

60
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:56,240
Where to, Boss?

61
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,360
Which hotel?

62
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:58,880
Hotel de Maze.

63
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,360
Wong Sai-lung, person in charge of Fullcoin.

64
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:05,720
He and Chin Tai-fu created
the Fullcoin scam.

65
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,760
Hired a hitman to take out his boss.

66
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:09,680
Target location...

67
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,200
Hotel de Maze.

68
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,160
What about the weapon?

69
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,280
It's ready. It's inside the hotel.

70
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:18,600
Ask for Sister Fong when you arrive.

71
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,680
Here's another gem.

72
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,760
The hell with it, for the money,

73
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,960
I don't care anymore.

74
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:32,000
Law Siu-fong, Fullcoin victim #2,

75
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:34,000
greedy chambermaid and doting mother.

76
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,160
Willing to do anything for a quick buck

77
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,920
to pay off her son's debt.

78
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,080
(Brother Kui)

79
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,160
(Pick-up code)

80
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:08,920
(Correct Pick-up code)

81
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:09,760
(Please pay the fee)

82
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:12,480
What? I had to pay?

83
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:32,040
Brother Fu, the room is booked in my name.

84
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,680
I'll check in for you.

85
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,840
You expect me to walk in like this?

86
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:38,640
I know you prefer the back door.

87
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,880
I got you a staff card.

88
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,360
Take the staff elevator up.

89
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,320
No one will know, OK?

90
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,600
Make sure you check the room carefully.

91
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,000
Of course, don't worry!

92
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,800
You bossed me around long enough.

93
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,880
You don't trust me and you're cheap.

94
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:57,720
You think $2M can take out Yip Wing-kei?

95
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:00,240
$2M is enough to kill you.

96
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,600
Mr. Wong, you're letting Mr. Chin
go up by himself?

97
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,880
He's suspicious and prefers to check
everything himself.

98
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,040
What can I do?

99
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,160
Thank you.

100
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:16,560
Honey, I saw online the jacuzzi in
the Ambassador Suite is beautiful.

101
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,480
It's worth the money.

102
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,120
Chin Chi-tat, today is the deadline.

103
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,760
Pay me before 12 o'clock.

104
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:28,640
Chin Chi-tat, Fullcoin victim #3.

105
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,680
A slave to designer labels,

106
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:32,000
a middle-class big spender who
spends beyond his means.

107
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,480
He dotes on his wife.

108
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,600
I'm sorry, Mr. and Mrs. Chin.

109
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,600
The sprinkler system is not working
in the Ambassador Suite.

110
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,720
It's temporarily closed.

111
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:42,240
What? Just when we're about to check in?

112
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,720
We can put you in the Executive Suite.

113
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,000
It's OK, Honey.

114
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,840
The Executive Suite should be nice.

115
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,280
Who says it's OK?

116
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,880
I told all my besties

117
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:54,000
we booked the Ambassador Suite
for our wedding anniversary.

118
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,480
What can I tell them now?

119
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,920
Chan Lai-sa, materialistic wife

120
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,280
and social media addict.

121
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:03,760
You have a full head of white hair!

122
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,600
Are you Sister Fong?

123
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,840
Of course!

124
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,240
Three outfits?

125
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,920
You need them for filming, right?

126
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,040
It's better to have spares.

127
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,040
I don't want you to keep coming back to me.

128
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,880
$2,000 for three sets.

129
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,160
$2,000?

130
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:19,920
Look at the bleach stain! That's too much!

131
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,240
Without the stain, how can I write them off?

132
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,680
I won't be able to give them to you, pal.

133
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,160
Fork over the money, $2,000!

134
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,880
Target...

135
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,360
Hey, you can't go that way.

136
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,160
That's for staff only.

137
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:36,160
Go to the back, hurry!

138
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,920
Mr. Wong, your Ambassador Suite is ready.

139
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,080
Thank you.

140
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,440
I thought they said it was closed.

141
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:46,320
I checked online, only the Ambassador Suite
has a gold keycard.

142
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:48,160
Brother Fu, I'm going up with
the bodyguards.

143
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,840
It's the second one on the 12/F after
you get off the elevator.

144
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:53,040
Is that the guy in charge of Fullcoin,

145
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:55,600
who ripped off a lot of people?
What's his name?

146
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,800
Wong Sai-lung.

147
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,600
You wanted to invest in it too.

148
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,040
Luckily, I stopped you.

149
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,160
Or else, you would have been cleaned out.

150
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:05,120
Yes, good thing I listened to you.

151
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:09,680
Why would anyone need so many bodyguards?

152
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:12,400
It's best not to mess with a triad boss.

153
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,480
Mr. and Mrs. Chin, have you decided?

154
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,240
We'll take the Executive Suite.

155
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,920
It's OK, Honey!

156
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,360
The difference in money

157
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:22,880
should buy us a nice candlelit dinner
for your pictures.

158
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,400
Sister Fong, you're in luck.

159
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,560
They put you on the 12/F.

160
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:31,000
The guests of the Ambassador Suite
are usually big tippers.

161
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:35,600
They updated the guest list.

162
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,720
Who is it?

163
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:39,280
Check your staff app.

164
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:42,320
A couple checked into the
Executive Suite on the 12/F.

165
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,240
They're celebrating their
wedding anniversary.

166
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,000
They should be big tippers too.

167
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,120
You're in luck.

168
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:49,280
Sister Fong, here's another gem.

169
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,120
(Ambassador Suite and Executive Suite)

170
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,560
Where is it?

171
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,200
The second one?

172
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,120
This should be it.

173
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:46,880
Welcome to our hotel, Mr. Chin.

174
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,000
You know me?

175
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:50,080
Of course!

176
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,840
While your wife is not around,

177
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,160
surprise her with these flowers.

178
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,920
My wife is here?

179
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:01,680
Chin Tai-fu took the Ambassador Suite.

180
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,240
But Wong Sai-lung checked in just now.

181
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:07,440
That's the job of a minion.

182
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,960
You and Mrs. Chin checked into
our Executive Suite.

183
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,440
I'm not mistaken.

184
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,960
I think you mean us.

185
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:18,800
This Mr. Chin is in the Ambassador Suite.

186
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,040
This clown's last name is also Chin?

187
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,840
Why is he being so helpful?

188
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:27,520
He's looking for perks because
he recognizes me?

189
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,480
Mr. Chin...
Yes!

190
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,800
I have worked with your group before.

191
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,240
I wonder if you remember me.

192
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:36,640
He's looking for a business deal.

193
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,040
Thanks for your help.

194
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,720
Let's talk when we have a chance.

195
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,000
Why not now?

196
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:44,800
I can take pictures of your
Ambassador Suite.

197
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,960
No...please get some rest, Mr. Chin.

198
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,000
We're right next door.

199
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,680
Please call me on the house phone.

200
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,080
What's wrong?

201
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,720
You can't rush into a deal.

202
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,800
He's next door. We'll get our chance.

203
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,320
Brother Fu...

204
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:20,320
Are you satisfied with the room?

205
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:24,480
I know you don't like the hotel linen.

206
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:26,480
I brought your personal bedding over.

207
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,080
I'll get that changed for you later.

208
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:30,720
Am I here on vacation?

209
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:33,040
I'm being hunted down.

210
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,440
You booked me into the most flamboyant
room in the hotel.

211
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:36,560
Are you stupid or what?

212
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:38,320
You don't understand, Brother Fu.

213
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:41,320
This floor has the least traffic.

214
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,120
It's the safest.

215
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:43,920
Least traffic?

216
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,480
Yes.

217
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:45,840
Just now, right outside,

218
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,680
I saw a couple check in.

219
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:50,880
You said it was the second room
after I got out of the elevator.

220
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:53,040
Even the chambermaid recognized me.

221
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,640
I'm sorry, Brother Fu.

222
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,720
I didn't know you took the staff elevator.

223
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,400
I'll file a complaint right away.

224
00:11:58,520 --> 00:12:00,240
You do that as you want.

225
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,320
Don't use my name.

226
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,800
Tell them to turn off the CCTV
on this floor.

227
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:05,840
Turn it off?

228
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,440
I passed by the security room.

229
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,760
Those clowns were shooting the breeze.

230
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,000
If the hitman disguised as a
security guard and saw the CCTV,

231
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:13,600
he'll know where I am.

232
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:15,360
How can you protect me?

233
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:17,920
But if we turned off the CCTV,
if the hitman showed up,

234
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,760
no one would know. That's too dangerous.

235
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:22,560
If it's not dangerous, why would I need
people around me?

236
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:24,800
Who's calling the shots now? Me or you?

237
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:28,720
You, of course! Everyone follows your lead.

238
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,320
Does that hurt?

239
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:35,920
Don't worry!

240
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:40,240
I hired these two from the #1
security consultant in the world.

241
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,920
They're the best of the best.

242
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,600
No English!

243
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,680
They're the top.

244
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:51,520
You picked this consultant yourself.

245
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:53,760
It must be safe and reliable.

246
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:54,480
Get out...

247
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,560
I'll leave you now. I'm right downstairs.

248
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,920
Call me if you need me.

249
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,520
OK, I'm going. Bye!

250
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,480
(Timer)

251
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,080
Disguise, check.

252
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:15,760
Escape route, check.

253
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:17,920
Weapon, check.

254
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,240
(Honey)

255
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:32,960
Honey?

256
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:36,000
Don't call me that anymore. We're divorced.

257
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:37,920
Did you put money in my account?

258
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:40,800
Yes! $250K.

259
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:43,920
Shit!

260
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:44,960
Don't curse me!

261
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:48,960
No...I'm not. I'll call you right back.

262
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:08,320
Target in Ambassador Suite on the 12/F.

263
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,240
Get inside to change the bedding.

264
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,680
Hurry up.

265
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:12,880
There are five bullets left.

266
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,640
I only need one.

267
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,600
What's wrong with you?

268
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:35,280
You screwed up the guest's name?

269
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,680
No, I addressed him as Mr. Chin.

270
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:38,880
He answered me

271
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,560
and asked me if I recognized him.

272
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:41,760
Don't bother to deny it.

273
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:44,400
A greeting is most important
in the hotel business.

274
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:45,840
You screwed up his name

275
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,240
and affected the most important
guest in the hotel.

276
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,520
You are fired.

277
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,120
I know you never liked me.

278
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,720
This is your excuse to settle
a personal score.

279
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:55,440
I'll tell management you set me up.

280
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:57,120
Don't think you can fool me.

281
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,200
You have stolen from the hotel.

282
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:03,280
Clothes, wine and sold them for profit.

283
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,960
I checked the linen room.

284
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,640
Three uniforms are missing.

285
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,400
You must have sold them.

286
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,560
My son is in the hospital.

287
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,560
He needs money for his surgery.

288
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:14,320
That's because he's stupid enough

289
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:16,480
to buy Fullcoin and got himself in debt

290
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,840
and then tried to kill himself.

291
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,120
That's enough, Yu Lo!

292
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,320
If you didn't look the other way,

293
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:22,320
I wouldn't have the chance to
steal anything.

294
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:26,560
Besides, I cut you in on the money I made.

295
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:28,160
I kept a record.

296
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:32,720
We're a team, before your shift is over,

297
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:34,080
if you bring back the three uniforms,

298
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,080
I'll pretend nothing happened.

299
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:39,120
Or else, you are fired.

300
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:41,600
I will call the Police and charge you
for theft.

301
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,040
Get out!

302
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,680
Fine. I'll get them back.

303
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,120
It's not here...

304
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:52,400
Sister Fong, I forgot the ice bucket.

305
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,760
Didn't he need the uniform for filming?

306
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,480
What is he doing with the housekeeping cart?

307
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:06,320
Who cares? I need the uniforms back.

308
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,080
Hey, Silver Fox!

309
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,360
Why are you posing as hotel staff?

310
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,480
What?

311
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,000
I don't care what you're up to.

312
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,200
I'll give you back your $2,000.

313
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,400
I want all three uniforms back.

314
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:16,480
I don't know what you mean. Out of my way.

315
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,800
Hey...

316
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,520
Hello, I'm coming.

317
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:26,000
Hey, come back...

318
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:29,200
A gun?

319
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,320
Is Silver Fox a hitman after Mr. Chin?

320
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:40,960
If he's caught by the Police,

321
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,160
and they found out I sold him the uniform,

322
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,640
will I be an accomplice?

323
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,120
It's murder. Should I call the Police?

324
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:49,640
I have you to thank if I got fired.

325
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,520
You lost your way and complained about me!

326
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,720
You can go to Hell.

327
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:56,000
Law Siu-fong, what are you doing here?

328
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,640
Get to work!

329
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:58,960
I told you to look for the uniforms,

330
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:01,200
that doesn't mean you don't have to work.

331
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,240
Are you done here?

332
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,440
Go to the 10/F, someone just checked out.

333
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:07,080
I don't have time to do both.

334
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,160
Just return the uniforms before
your shift is over.

335
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:12,000
Or else, don't blame me.

336
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,760
Watch it!

337
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:15,680
Fine, I'll look.

338
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:18,480
Calling the Police is a big deal.

339
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:21,440
Better let sleeping dogs lie.

340
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,560
A4 Hidagyu for two.

341
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,720
Thank you.

342
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:33,080
I can finally check in.

343
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,280
Please sign here, Sir!

344
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,960
Something wrong with the bill?

345
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,720
No. It's OK.

346
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:43,880
Thank you.

347
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,520
Enjoy your meal.

348
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,640
Thank you.

349
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:49,640
Cheers, Honey...

350
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,400
Let me get this...

351
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:03,520
Hello?

352
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:06,000
Chin Chi-tat, you have stalled me
for six months...

353
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:08,240
You must pay me today.

354
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:10,480
I really don't have the money.

355
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:12,840
I invested my company in Fullcoin.

356
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,880
I lost all my cash flow.

357
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:17,040
If you don't pay me today,

358
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:19,160
I'll show up at your office and your house.

359
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:22,160
Don't...I can't tell my wife.

360
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:24,160
Hello?

361
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:27,680
Honey, what's wrong with you lately?

362
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,280
You seem tight on money.

363
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:32,240
When you signed the bill and
tipped room service,

364
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:34,160
you looked like you had toothache.

365
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:37,680
No...I do have toothache.

366
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,440
Are you OK?

367
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:41,400
Probably from staying up late.

368
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:44,960
We're on staycation. Forget work.

369
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:48,880
Why did you kiss up to that guy just now?

370
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,760
You need insight when you do business.

371
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,440
Remember back then,

372
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,400
I was the first person to think of
the shared wardrobe concept.

373
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:57,800
That's how we make money.

374
00:18:57,880 --> 00:19:00,320
You're a biz wiz, but I'm not.

375
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:01,840
That's why I must work hard.

376
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:05,040
True. Only because of you,

377
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,040
this biz wiz sold her business.

378
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:09,040
You really must be good to me.

379
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:13,080
Your husband is a grateful man.

380
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,880
Honey, this is for you.

381
00:19:15,040 --> 00:19:16,320
That's better.

382
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,640
Well? Do you like it?

383
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:25,800
This bag...

384
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:29,600
was the most rented item
back then in the shared wardrobe days.

385
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:31,560
That was three years ago.

386
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:34,240
It's our third wedding anniversary.

387
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,640
I bought it because I think it's meaningful.

388
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:38,360
Happy third anniversary.

389
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:42,320
I didn't go for anything meaningful.

390
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:43,760
Here...

391
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,200
Thanks, Honey!

392
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:51,640
This is not yet available on the market!

393
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:53,880
Only VIPs can pre-order.

394
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,840
It'll be launched in three months.

395
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:59,440
It looks expensive.

396
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:01,920
Stop talking about money.

397
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:05,200
Money should be made, not saved.

398
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:07,120
You need to meet with clients,

399
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,960
you must look presentable.

400
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:15,840
The food is not really that great.

401
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:19,640
Let's go to the south of France this year.

402
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:21,760
I'll be very busy this year,

403
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:24,000
I may not get much time off.

404
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,640
You're always busy,

405
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:28,880
but I don't see any actual results.

406
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:33,920
Answer it. Work is more important...

407
00:20:35,840 --> 00:20:36,720
Hello?

408
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,720
I have done all I can for you.

409
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:41,400
Before midnight tonight, just pay me
the interest.

410
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:43,280
You need to give me time, pal.

411
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:45,320
I'll need time to sell stuff.

412
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:46,720
Did you hear what I said?

413
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,880
What are you selling me?

414
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,680
Hey, are you changing the sheets?

415
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,120
What's taking so long?

416
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:01,920
Yes!

417
00:21:02,080 --> 00:21:03,320
Get over here!

418
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,400
Let me check...

419
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:27,840
Shit!

420
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,080
What's wrong?

421
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:31,200
Just checking to see if I forgot anything.

422
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,800
Hello, Mr. Chin.

423
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:45,280
Changing the sheets? Go ahead.

424
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,720
Sure.

425
00:21:52,520 --> 00:21:53,920
Without the gun,

426
00:21:54,280 --> 00:21:56,640
I can't fight three of them.

427
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:58,320
This is my only chance to get him up close.

428
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,920
I may not get another chance.

429
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,400
It's not worth taking my chances.

430
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:08,040
Clear the table for me first.

431
00:22:09,040 --> 00:22:10,400
Yes, Mr. Chin.

432
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:16,160
Why is he staring at me?

433
00:22:16,240 --> 00:22:19,200
Did he figure out who I am?

434
00:22:20,320 --> 00:22:22,120
Turn down the air-con a bit.

435
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,920
No, don't cower.

436
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,560
Sure.

437
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,640
Use the pad.

438
00:22:39,560 --> 00:22:41,920
Are you here to kill me?

439
00:22:55,520 --> 00:22:58,320
Are you here to kill me?

440
00:22:58,440 --> 00:23:00,160
Mr. Chin...you got this all wrong...

441
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:03,600
I saw you sneaking around this morning.

442
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:06,240
See? You have my picture.

443
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:09,200
Actually...I'm a huge fan.

444
00:23:09,320 --> 00:23:12,400
I only wanted your autograph.

445
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:15,360
A fan? Then you should know me well.

446
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,360
What type of movie stars do I like?

447
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,720
Yu Ssu-ting!

448
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:19,920
Ting my foot!

449
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,920
Everyone knows I like middle-aged chicks.

450
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:24,640
Tell me or I'll break your arm.

451
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:25,320
I'm sorry, Mr. Chin.

452
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:27,560
I was forced to take this job.

453
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:28,720
Please let me go.

454
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:30,800
Did Yip Wing-kei order the hit?

455
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:33,840
The billionaire Yip Wing-kei is my Boss?

456
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,360
Quit your act!

457
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:36,480
Is everything OK, Mr. Chin?

458
00:23:36,600 --> 00:23:37,200
I'm OK.

459
00:23:37,360 --> 00:23:39,200
My Boss is Chit Chat Kui.

460
00:23:39,320 --> 00:23:41,440
I don't know who he works for.

461
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:44,560
Chit Chat Kui? He works for Sai-lung.

462
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:47,080
I heard screaming.

463
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:48,960
Was the housekeeper up to no good?

464
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:51,680
He held Mr. Chin hostage and forced him
to say OK?

465
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:55,080
Easy...Mr. Chin!

466
00:23:55,280 --> 00:23:57,920
Sorry to interrupt.

467
00:23:58,080 --> 00:24:00,800
Who said you could come in? Get out!

468
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:03,080
Of course, Mr. Chin!

469
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:06,560
Sai-lung that ingrate!

470
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:08,640
He used my money to kill me!

471
00:24:08,760 --> 00:24:11,200
I'll pay you double to kill him.

472
00:24:11,320 --> 00:24:13,800
What? You're my Boss' Boss?

473
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:16,320
I'm your Boss' Boss' Boss.

474
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:17,640
Kill him for me.

475
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:21,160
Wong Sai-lung? The weasel behind Fullcoin?

476
00:24:21,520 --> 00:24:23,200
He was the creep who landed me in debt.

477
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:24,840
My Boss works for him?

478
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:27,440
Punks are not to be trusted.

479
00:24:27,560 --> 00:24:29,920
That weasel Sai-lung spread the rumor

480
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:31,680
about Yip Wing-kei putting a price
on my head

481
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:32,880
so I would give him money

482
00:24:33,040 --> 00:24:34,720
to hire a hitman to kill him.

483
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:38,480
But he used my money to hire
a stooge like you to kill me instead.

484
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:39,760
Don't you think he deserves to die?

485
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:41,800
A hired gun hired another gun.

486
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:43,440
He asked for it.

487
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:46,480
I'll take double and kill him for you.

488
00:24:46,600 --> 00:24:48,160
That's $4M.

489
00:24:48,320 --> 00:24:50,000
The job was $2M?

490
00:24:50,080 --> 00:24:51,400
I only got $500K!

491
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,880
You took $500K.

492
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:56,120
I'll double that and pay you $1M.

493
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:58,720
$1M is better than $500K.

494
00:24:59,440 --> 00:25:01,920
I have long wanted to kill Wong Sai-lung.

495
00:25:02,520 --> 00:25:03,200
You're on.

496
00:25:03,320 --> 00:25:04,240
What?

497
00:25:05,320 --> 00:25:06,720
I'll kill Wong Sai-lung.

498
00:25:08,760 --> 00:25:12,400
Wait! Take off your clothes.

499
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:14,280
I can't believe at a juncture like this,

500
00:25:14,360 --> 00:25:15,680
Mr. Chin is in the mood for that.

501
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:18,560
Who can resist a stud cupcake?

502
00:25:27,280 --> 00:25:28,640
Here!

503
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:32,280
He took his clothes off.

504
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:34,280
Mr. Chin must be a cross-dresser.

505
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:38,160
Where's the cart?

506
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:43,640
No clothes, no gun, how can I kill anyone?

507
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:46,160
Why does Sai-lung want me dead?

508
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:52,120
Because I made him the fall guy
in the Fullcoin scam?

509
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:58,480
Luckily, the bodyguards were hired
from the agent I picked.

510
00:25:58,600 --> 00:26:00,720
They probably don't work for him.

511
00:26:02,840 --> 00:26:05,520
But why did they let the hitman through?

512
00:26:08,120 --> 00:26:11,680
Did Sai-lung pay them off too?

513
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:14,320
What are you looking at?

514
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:15,760
Close the door!

515
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,600
Yes, Mr. Chin.

516
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:23,360
Looks like it.

517
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:27,600
Sai-lung probably used them to
keep an eye on me

518
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:29,640
and report back to him.

519
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:36,720
If I stayed, I'm as good as dead.

520
00:26:37,120 --> 00:26:39,600
Didn't you say earlier your husband
seems stingy towards you

521
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,960
and didn't spend as much time with you?

522
00:26:41,080 --> 00:26:42,320
How's your anniversary?

523
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:45,640
At least he brought me to the
Ambassador Suite of this hotel.

524
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:47,200
That's good.

525
00:26:47,360 --> 00:26:50,040
Don't forget to make a video and show me.

526
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:52,840
I heard their jacuzzi is very pretty.

527
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:55,120
Show me the video, hurry!

528
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,400
Yes, it's quite nice.

529
00:26:56,520 --> 00:26:58,480
But my husband is using it right now.

530
00:26:58,680 --> 00:27:01,160
Honey, my business partner is nearby.

531
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:02,480
I need to go talk to him.

532
00:27:02,600 --> 00:27:05,840
I can't talk now. I have something to do.

533
00:27:05,960 --> 00:27:07,040
Be careful!

534
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:08,360
Of what?

535
00:27:08,520 --> 00:27:11,040
Why does he have to take a bath
to see his partner?

536
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:12,880
Didn't you say he's been acting weird?

537
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:14,640
Maybe there's another woman.

538
00:27:14,760 --> 00:27:16,720
We just had a small argument.

539
00:27:16,920 --> 00:27:18,720
I think he's stepping out for
some fresh air.

540
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:21,440
What if he's stepping out to see
another woman?

541
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:23,600
You better follow him.

542
00:27:23,720 --> 00:27:25,440
OK, I'll go check on him.

543
00:27:25,600 --> 00:27:27,080
Gotta go. Bye!

544
00:27:28,360 --> 00:27:28,960
Hello, Roy?

545
00:27:29,080 --> 00:27:31,440
You have reached the voice mail of 98...

546
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:33,360
Voice mail?

547
00:27:51,560 --> 00:27:52,480
Hello?

548
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:54,240
Hello, Mrs. Chin?

549
00:27:54,360 --> 00:27:56,160
It's Chin Tai-fu from next door.

550
00:28:03,320 --> 00:28:04,720
I know, you sent me to the 10/F

551
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:06,280
so I won't have time to find the uniforms

552
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:08,240
and then you can fire me.

553
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:12,960
You evil witch, I wish you won't
live to see tomorrow...

554
00:28:14,120 --> 00:28:15,520
What is that?

555
00:28:18,520 --> 00:28:20,640
People nowadays have no shame.

556
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:28,160
This is outrageous!

557
00:28:28,280 --> 00:28:30,560
People on the 10/F don't do refills?

558
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:56,320
Hello? It's a real gun. You want it?

559
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:59,320
Try it out first, if it's a fake,

560
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:01,640
you're paying me double the interest.

561
00:29:08,560 --> 00:29:10,320
This isn't thick enough.

562
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:35,600
Excuse me, I'm here to see Mr. Chin.

563
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:37,280
What about?

564
00:29:38,800 --> 00:29:42,080
That's none of your business.

565
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:43,360
Open the door!

566
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:46,640
Before you go in, mind if I frisk you?

567
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:47,680
Brother Fu...

568
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:49,200
Mind if frisk you?

569
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:50,480
What game are you playing?

570
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:52,000
Sorry, Mr. Chin!

571
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:56,960
Sorry...it's boring in the room.

572
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:58,240
Let's go get something to eat.

573
00:29:58,360 --> 00:29:59,600
Sure!

574
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:00,800
I'll go down to take a break.

575
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,480
Wait for me up here.

576
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:06,160
Mr. Chin, it's dangerous for you
to run around.

577
00:30:06,320 --> 00:30:08,000
It's quite nice inside the suite.

578
00:30:08,120 --> 00:30:09,160
Why don't you call room service?

579
00:30:09,280 --> 00:30:10,800
You can relax inside while you eat.

580
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,320
How?

581
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:14,120
I'd like you to show me.

582
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:16,720
How dangerous is it to go downstairs
for a bite?

583
00:30:16,840 --> 00:30:18,040
Just wait here.

584
00:30:21,840 --> 00:30:23,880
Mr. Chin is quite unbridled.

585
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:26,640
He doesn't care her husband is next door.

586
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:28,240
He takes both man and woman.

587
00:30:28,360 --> 00:30:29,440
Shall we still follow him?

588
00:30:29,560 --> 00:30:31,080
Of course! If anything happens to him,

589
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:32,640
we're in deep trouble.

590
00:30:35,040 --> 00:30:36,400
Mr. Chin...

591
00:30:38,440 --> 00:30:40,720
I told you not to follow me.

592
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:42,720
Wait in my room.

593
00:30:46,840 --> 00:30:48,560
Why is the door locked?

594
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:52,840
Rats! My key card is inside.

595
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,640
Anyone in there?

596
00:30:56,520 --> 00:30:58,280
When your luck is against you...

597
00:30:58,400 --> 00:31:00,040
I'll need to get the spare key.

598
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:01,520
What a waste of time!

599
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,400
Thank you.

600
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:09,760
I need your help with something.

601
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:13,120
Help? How can I help you?

602
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:16,160
My bodyguards are a pain.

603
00:31:16,320 --> 00:31:18,880
I need your help to ditch them.

604
00:31:19,280 --> 00:31:21,440
Mr. Chin, you promised me

605
00:31:21,600 --> 00:31:24,480
I can take pictures of the Ambassador Suite.

606
00:31:24,640 --> 00:31:26,720
Sure. I'll give you the key card later.

607
00:31:26,840 --> 00:31:28,040
Great!

608
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:30,960
All these towels should be enough.

609
00:31:31,120 --> 00:31:33,280
The bullet won't get through.

610
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:38,400
Hello?

611
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:39,400
Boss?

612
00:31:39,520 --> 00:31:41,560
Where the hell are you?

613
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,960
I'm downstairs at the hotel.

614
00:31:43,120 --> 00:31:44,120
Bring the car around.

615
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:46,960
I can't. I thought you'd be safe
at the hotel.

616
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:49,640
I went to Shenzhen to find out

617
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,920
who accepted the hit on you.

618
00:31:52,040 --> 00:31:54,360
Shenzhen? What did you find out?

619
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:56,960
A hitman syndicate took the order

620
00:31:57,120 --> 00:31:58,840
and they sent several hitmen after you.

621
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,400
It's dangerous out there.

622
00:32:00,520 --> 00:32:02,320
What?

623
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:04,640
I'm on my way back.

624
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:06,480
Stay in the hotel.

625
00:32:06,560 --> 00:32:09,560
It's safer with two bodyguards around you.

626
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:17,360
Why did Roy go north at this juncture?

627
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:20,040
Did Sai-lung bribe him?

628
00:32:24,760 --> 00:32:27,440
He said he was meeting his business partner.

629
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:30,520
Sorry, something came up. I can't help you.

630
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:46,160
What is it?

631
00:32:46,280 --> 00:32:48,640
Hi, I was the last guest in this room.

632
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:50,560
I think I left something behind.

633
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:52,400
Can I come in and take a look?

634
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:54,480
Go talk to the reception.

635
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:08,280
Roy worked for me for years.

636
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:10,160
Would he betray me?

637
00:33:10,560 --> 00:33:12,880
If he was telling the truth,

638
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:19,120
there are several hitmen after me.

639
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:22,400
Would I live to leave this hotel?

640
00:33:26,360 --> 00:33:27,680
What are you doing here?

641
00:33:27,800 --> 00:33:28,880
We're worried about you.

642
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,480
We figure you may need the car.

643
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,680
So we split up

644
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:33,920
and check the lobby and the car park.

645
00:33:34,520 --> 00:33:36,400
He can't be that smart.

646
00:33:36,600 --> 00:33:38,760
Roy must have tipped him off.

647
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:41,880
I can't beat them both.

648
00:33:42,040 --> 00:33:43,360
I shouldn't take them head on.

649
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:45,920
I need to find a way to ditch them.

650
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:47,880
Mr. Chin, if you have relaxed,

651
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,600
let's go back upstairs.

652
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:51,400
OK!

653
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:52,880
Thanks, Mr. Chin.

654
00:34:16,160 --> 00:34:18,480
Chin Chi-tat, open the door!

655
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:21,360
Are you in there? I know you're inside!

656
00:34:25,200 --> 00:34:27,520
Chin Chi-tat, I recognize your ringtone.

657
00:34:27,680 --> 00:34:29,240
How dare you hang up on me!

658
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:31,920
Open the door!
My uniform!

659
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:35,720
Aren't you Mrs. Chin from the
12/F Executive Suite?

660
00:34:35,800 --> 00:34:36,800
You're not a staff member,

661
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:38,320
why are you wearing our uniform?

662
00:34:38,440 --> 00:34:39,840
I'm so glad to see you.

663
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:41,440
My husband is cheating on me
inside this room.

664
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:43,200
Can you open the door for me?

665
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:45,280
How about this?

666
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:47,680
OK...tell me,

667
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:49,280
where did you get this uniform?

668
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:52,000
In the backstairs by the elevator,

669
00:34:52,160 --> 00:34:53,520
inside the laundry cart.

670
00:34:53,640 --> 00:34:55,360
It was inside a bag.

671
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:58,160
The laundry cart? Was there another uniform?

672
00:34:58,280 --> 00:35:00,680
Yes...hurry up!

673
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:04,880
Chin Chi-tat...

674
00:35:05,080 --> 00:35:06,240
There's no one here.

675
00:35:06,360 --> 00:35:08,320
I'm sure I heard his ringtone.

676
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:09,200
Did I make a mistake?

677
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:11,440
Maybe you heard wrong
because you were too nervous?

678
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:13,600
Maybe your husband is waiting for you
in your suite.

679
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:15,600
Why don't you give me the uniform

680
00:35:15,720 --> 00:35:17,680
and go back upstairs to look
for your husband?

681
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:20,000
Look at this!

682
00:35:20,120 --> 00:35:23,360
That only proves the last guest was a woman.

683
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:24,720
It's perfectly normal.

684
00:35:24,840 --> 00:35:26,320
Just give me back the uniform.

685
00:35:27,640 --> 00:35:30,800
A used condom!

686
00:35:30,880 --> 00:35:34,480
It's normal for a woman to have a boyfriend.

687
00:35:34,600 --> 00:35:36,400
Give me the uniform.

688
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,000
Hey!

689
00:35:40,640 --> 00:35:42,000
There's another room?

690
00:35:44,160 --> 00:35:46,800
Hey...

691
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:51,240
Chin Chi-tat...your creep!

692
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,520
What are you doing there crouching down?

693
00:35:53,640 --> 00:35:54,880
Where's the other woman?

694
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,800
What woman? There's no one here.

695
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:59,120
It's not what you think.

696
00:35:59,240 --> 00:36:00,800
What have you done?

697
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:02,880
I just came into this room.

698
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,800
Whatever happened in here
had nothing to do with me.

699
00:36:04,960 --> 00:36:05,840
If you were never in the room,

700
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:07,200
how did you know what was inside?

701
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:09,520
I'll explain later. I'm in a hurry...

702
00:36:09,600 --> 00:36:10,880
Chin Chi-tat, where are you going?

703
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:11,920
You better explain this...

704
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:13,680
Hey you... don't go yet...
Are you cheating on me?

705
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:15,280
Give me back the uniform!

706
00:36:16,040 --> 00:36:17,440
One down...

707
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:19,520
Another one in the laundry cart
in the backstairs.

708
00:36:19,680 --> 00:36:22,480
Then I'll find Silver Fox and get
the one he's wearing.

709
00:36:23,720 --> 00:36:25,920
Where's the laundry cart?

710
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:28,400
Do I have to look floor to floor?

711
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:31,160
Wait, how stupid of me!

712
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:35,120
Let me see...at this hour,
they're collecting the laundry.

713
00:36:35,240 --> 00:36:37,760
All the laundry carts will be in the
laundry room on the ground floor.

714
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:38,880
Yes!

715
00:36:39,040 --> 00:36:41,280
Don't scratch the gun! Go away!

716
00:36:42,200 --> 00:36:45,200
He's no fun. Let's go.

717
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:53,680
Is it a real gun?

718
00:36:58,040 --> 00:36:59,360
We have a deal.

719
00:37:00,240 --> 00:37:01,920
That's your interest for this month.

720
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:10,280
Manager...

721
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,920
Thanks for your hospitality.

722
00:37:12,080 --> 00:37:13,360
Dinner was delicious.

723
00:37:13,560 --> 00:37:14,880
You're helping us with our Feng Shui,

724
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:16,960
showing our hospitality is the least
we can do.

725
00:37:17,080 --> 00:37:18,760
The manager seems to believe
everything this woman said.

726
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:20,080
You think she's any good?

727
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:21,520
That's Sylvia the psychic!

728
00:37:21,680 --> 00:37:24,200
She's a big hit because she's
pretty and gifted.

729
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,520
I'd like to have her tell my fortune.

730
00:37:25,600 --> 00:37:27,280
Sylvia...

731
00:37:27,400 --> 00:37:28,680
I'm such a big fan...
You're so pretty...

732
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:30,200
I watched your livecast last night...
Can I take a picture with you?

733
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:32,080
Thank you.
I want one too...

734
00:37:32,200 --> 00:37:34,000
Hey!
Manager!

735
00:37:34,160 --> 00:37:35,520
Why do you seem so flustered?

736
00:37:35,680 --> 00:37:37,640
I'm looking for something.

737
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:38,640
What?

738
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:42,800
Excuse me...lately, have you been
losing things you want?

739
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:45,440
and things you don't want keep
pestering you?

740
00:37:45,560 --> 00:37:46,800
Yes!

741
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:49,200
Let me help you with divination.

742
00:37:49,280 --> 00:37:52,200
Pen Fairy...

743
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:56,800
This lady wants to know her future...

744
00:37:58,480 --> 00:38:02,720
Look, it's moving...
I told you the Pen Fairy is real...

745
00:38:06,120 --> 00:38:08,280
Thank you, Pen Fairy!

746
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,800
What does this mean?

747
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:14,080
The Chinese character "one"
and the number 18?

748
00:38:14,240 --> 00:38:17,600
You'll know when the time comes.

749
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:24,080
Where's the laundry cart from the 10/F?

750
00:38:24,200 --> 00:38:25,760
I had to go floor to floor again?

751
00:38:34,200 --> 00:38:36,080
While I'm away,

752
00:38:36,240 --> 00:38:39,440
whatever I want to happen
should have happened.

753
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:42,280
The key is I have an alibi.

754
00:38:42,400 --> 00:38:44,640
If anything happens to that
creep Chin Tai-fu,

755
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:46,400
the cops won't connect that to me.

756
00:38:46,560 --> 00:38:48,280
Using his own money to kill him

757
00:38:48,400 --> 00:38:50,320
was a perfect plan.

758
00:38:54,320 --> 00:38:55,200
Brother Lung!

759
00:38:55,520 --> 00:38:58,320
Well? Did the hitman show up?

760
00:38:58,520 --> 00:38:59,360
No.

761
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:00,760
No?

762
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:03,520
Did anything unusual happen?

763
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:04,760
Yes!

764
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:05,360
What?

765
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:08,160
He's into both man and woman.

766
00:39:08,280 --> 00:39:09,680
Get serious.

767
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:13,760
Listen up, nothing happened now
doesn't mean nothing will.

768
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:14,800
Stay on your toes.

769
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:16,400
Right, Brother Lung.

770
00:39:16,800 --> 00:39:19,240
Who did Chit Chat Kui hire?

771
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:21,240
What took him so long?

772
00:39:34,040 --> 00:39:35,840
What's the matter with you?

773
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:37,920
Why didn't the hitman take action?

774
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:39,240
He didn't?

775
00:39:39,320 --> 00:39:40,680
He took the money but did nothing.

776
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:42,080
What now?

777
00:39:42,200 --> 00:39:45,680
I never let you down all these years, right?

778
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:48,240
It's just a matter of time, don't worry.

779
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:50,080
I got something for you.

780
00:40:10,960 --> 00:40:13,840
This is the gun I gave the hitman.

781
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:14,720
You're kidding!

782
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:17,640
No! Now I know why the hitman did nothing.

783
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:19,280
He lost the gun!

784
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:21,440
Who did you hire for the job?

785
00:40:21,560 --> 00:40:22,680
He's a buddy of mine.

786
00:40:22,800 --> 00:40:24,160
He's down on his luck

787
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,040
so I gave him the job,

788
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:26,160
knowing he'll give it his best shot.

789
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:26,800
But...

790
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:28,640
But? You should talk!

791
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:30,320
Call him now and find out where he is.

792
00:40:32,480 --> 00:40:34,200
(Brother Kui)

793
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:35,720
Boss!

794
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:37,200
Did you lose your gun?

795
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:39,840
Damn! He found out. What now?

796
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:42,880
You should talk. The locker was empty.

797
00:40:43,040 --> 00:40:44,080
No gun?

798
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:46,640
Ask him...

799
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:50,560
No way. The Boss said he put
the gun in the locker.

800
00:40:50,680 --> 00:40:51,520
How come?

801
00:40:51,640 --> 00:40:54,400
There was nothing in the locker.

802
00:40:54,520 --> 00:40:57,280
What did you put it into?

803
00:40:57,440 --> 00:41:00,320
What box did you use? Was it stolen?

804
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:12,280
Did that guy want the Gundam box?

805
00:41:12,400 --> 00:41:15,360
He pried open the locker after I left?

806
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:17,040
Here's my Boss...

807
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,880
That creep Wong Sai-lung?

808
00:41:19,040 --> 00:41:20,400
What have you been doing?

809
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:24,640
I'm trying to figure out how to kill
without a gun.

810
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:27,240
Why bother? We got the gun back.

811
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:29,120
I'll personally hand it to you.

812
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:30,560
Where should we meet? Name the place.

813
00:41:30,840 --> 00:41:34,680
I did my research. The cold storage
on the ground floor has less traffic.

814
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:36,760
Go down there now.

815
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:38,880
My Boss will meet you there and
hand you the gun.

816
00:41:39,880 --> 00:41:42,400
Hey...what does he look like?

817
00:41:42,520 --> 00:41:44,000
White hair dude wearing a uniform.

818
00:41:44,080 --> 00:41:45,440
Easy to spot.

819
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:46,800
OK!

820
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:49,040
Wong Sai-lung will give me the gun.

821
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:51,600
I can shoot him on the spot.

822
00:41:54,560 --> 00:41:58,280
Bloody hell, why the cold storage
of all places?

823
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:59,640
This is nuts!

824
00:42:03,680 --> 00:42:06,240
OK, Silver Fox. I'm giving
the gun to you again.

825
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:07,280
Don't waste any more time.

826
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:09,920
Go kill Chin Tai-fu right away. Hurry...
